# .cg-cache.json and .os-slugs.json are deliberately NOT ignored: the first is
# the market-data snapshot data.js was built from (so a rebuild is reproducible
# rather than re-priced), and the second records which OpenSea slug guesses
# resolved. Together they save a ~30 minute rate-limited refetch on a fresh
# clone. They are inputs to a build, not build output.
